<title>USA: SyQuest names Montgomery financial chief.</title>
<headline>SyQuest names Montgomery financial chief.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>SyQest Technology Inc said on Friday it named Henry Montgomery chief financial officer and executive vice president.</p>
<p>John Luhtala, the former chief financial officer, was named to the newly created position of vice president of mergers, acquisitions and joint ventures, the company said.</p>
<p>Before joining SyQuest, Montgomery served as president and chief executive of New Media Corp.</p>
